@host = http://localhost:5000

### Create a company (201 + Location)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Verus LLC",
  "website": "https://www.verus.com"
}

### Acronym match (201)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "International Business Machines",
  "website": "https://www.ibm.com"
}

### Domain doesn't match; accepted via the home page title (201, needs network)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacker News",
  "website": "https://news.ycombinator.com"
}

### Name not relevant to the website (400, company.not_relevant)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme",
  "website": "https://www.example.com"
}

### Field validation (400, errors.name + errors.website)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "website": "not a url"
}

### Same registrable domain again (409, company.duplicate_website)
POST {{host}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Verus",
  "website": "https://shop.verus.com"
}

### List all (200, sorted by name)
GET {{host}}/api/companies

### Relevance search (200, ordered by relevanceScore)
GET {{host}}/api/companies?q=verus

### Filter by name fragment and by domain
GET {{host}}/api/companies?name=verus&domain=verus.com

### Sort and page
GET {{host}}/api/companies?sort=-createdAt&page=1&pageSize=10

### Empty result is still 200
GET {{host}}/api/companies?name=nothing-matches

### Invalid query (400, query.invalid_page_size)
GET {{host}}/api/companies?pageSize=500

### Unknown id (404, company.not_found)
GET {{host}}/api/companies/00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000000

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
